        "raw": "<p>Wager Master says &quot;treat that card as if it had just been played.&quot; Seems pretty clear cut to me that that means it should be treated as if it entered play after all the other cards, and is thus processed AFTER any previously-played face up cards.</p><p>(If you ruled the other way, you could easily get into ambiguous situations where, due to the shuffling of face down cards, you didn&#39;t actually know what order the face up cards had entered play.)</p>",
